<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">

  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/images/favicon.svg">
    <title><%= data.company.name %></title>
    <meta name="title" content="Companies">
    <meta name="description" content="">
    <meta property="og:type" content="website">
    <meta property="og:title" content="">
    <meta property="og:description" content="">
    <meta property="og:image" content="">
    <meta property="og:url" content="">
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="">
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
    <link rel="icon" href="/images/favicon.svg" sizes="32x32">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/images/favicon.svg">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/sources/main.css">
    <script src="/sources/main.js" defer></script>
  </head>

  <body class="text-xs text-zinc-700 bg-zinc-50">
    <main>
      <section class="m-4 sm:m-10">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <h1 class="flex items-center gap-4 text-md sm:text-xl font-bold">
            <a href="/companies" class="block w-10 h-10 bg-zinc-300 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 17 17" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4">
                <path d="M9.61785 5.98595L11.5315 0.919794C11.7953 0.221241 10.8738 -0.322357 10.3482 0.221771L3.19002 7.63153C2.84466 7.98901 2.98974 8.57015 3.46604 8.73719L7.31537 10.0872C7.68274 10.2161 7.87215 10.6075 7.73845 10.9615L5.805 16.0801C5.53629 16.7914 6.49075 17.3321 7.00518 16.76L13.8268 9.17283C14.1517 8.81153 14.0001 8.24875 13.534 8.08525L10.0409 6.86016C9.67356 6.73135 9.48413 6.33994 9.61785 5.98595Z" fill="black"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
            <span><%= data.company.name %></span>
          </h1>
          <button onclick="update_modal.showModal()" class="cursor-pointer">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-4 h-4 stroke-zinc-300">
              <path d="M12 3H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-7"/><path d="M18.375 2.625a1 1 0 0 1 3 3l-9.013 9.014a2 2 0 0 1-.853.505l-2.873.84a.5.5 0 0 1-.62-.62l.84-2.873a2 2 0 0 1 .506-.852z"/>
            </svg>
          </button>
          <dialog id="update_modal" class="modal">
            <div class="modal-box sm:min-w-4xl py-20 sm:px-20 sm:py-35 bg-zinc-50">
              <h3 class="mb-5 text-xl text-center font-bold">Update company</h3>
              <%- include( 'update-form', { body: data.company } ); %>
            </div>
            <form method="dialog" class="modal-backdrop">
              <button>close</button>
            </form>
          </dialog>
          <button onclick="delete_modal.showModal()" class="cursor-pointer">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-4 h-4 stroke-zinc-300">
              <path d="M10 11v6"/><path d="M14 11v6"/><path d="M19 6v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6"/><path d="M3 6h18"/><path d="M8 6V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"/>
            </svg>
          </button>
          <dialog id="delete_modal" class="modal">
            <div class="modal-box sm:min-w-4xl py-20 sm:px-20 sm:py-35 bg-zinc-50">
              <h3 class="mb-5 text-xl text-center font-bold">Delete <%= data.company.name %></h3>
              <%- include( 'delete-form', { action: `${path}/delete` } ); %>
            </div>
            <form method="dialog" class="modal-backdrop">
              <button>close</button>
            </form>
          </dialog>
        </div>
        <div class="max-w-2xl mt-4 sm:mt-10 leading-[200%]">
          <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Alias molestias voluptatum eius ratione maxime ea, magni, nam voluptatibus beatae molestiae explicabo. Laudantium optio.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>

</html>